; empty_house.room - the empty house (docs/maps/README.md), Solstice's trials region.
; Tested by tests/scenes/world/rooms/trials/empty_house_test.gd.
;
; Combinado 4 (design 02 section 8.4, Verao + Outono): a door that holds only
; while both its plates do, far apart in a long corridor, and Ivo on the wrong
; side of both. Solstice and Sombra on the far plate (col 82); Soltar drops the
; cocoon on the near one (col 32); he walks back through the door with nobody on
; either. The shadow alone is gone before he walks from the far plate to the
; door, whatever the order and even rolling: Solstice is always needed.

[room]
origin = 0, -16

